{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7001_p", "source_sha256": "6f79948c15046e8fb31197c8a86b86741648ed5c04ca411d297307e6c11bba8c", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\n杏奈の撮影は順調に進み、今は休憩中だ……）", "zh": "（今天是写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄日。\n杏奈的拍摄进行得很顺利，现在正在休息……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7002_024ann", "source_sha256": "35fc7af18e9d5be1b453ab87a07b3f01ce706cba526e5dd18e1b5bddee07f3d8", "ja": "{$P$}、さん……。\nもし、杏奈が本当にスライムになったとしたら……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n如果杏奈真的变成史莱姆的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7003_024ann", "source_sha256": "71a4ab31218cbb6b22af29953166c46c692a1218e08edd2f158f9b342a865bb4", "ja": "どんな、スライムだったら……\nまたアイドルに、スカウトしてくれる……？", "zh": "要是变成什么样的史莱姆……您还会再次邀请杏奈成为偶像吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7004_p", "source_sha256": "d16e1e25c8807a547ffbaf8adaad8c8efb88bc9975d8daa899ffe819a439e974", "ja": "どんな姿だろうと、スカウトすると思うけど……。\nスライムって、そんなに種類があるのか？", "zh": "不管是什么样子，我应该都会来挖你当偶像吧……不过，史莱姆有那么多种吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7005_024ann", "source_sha256": "6607b1aae1cedb402f825f47efa4ec9aa3825e3de872f340d6804edf9ae78797", "ja": "うん……♪　ドロドロしてるの、とか……チート級に、\n強いのとか……。あと飛んだり、火を噴いたり……。", "zh": "嗯……♪　有黏糊糊的，还有……强到跟开挂一样的，\n之类的……。还有会飞的，会喷火的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7006_p", "source_sha256": "58b3114853d91b8657acf094f4fe2f8167a73f754b6d236dba52af8f786b1cc9", "ja": "へー、そんなにいるとは思わなかったよ。\nうーん、スライムのスカウトか……。", "zh": "哦——没想到居然有这么多啊。\n嗯——招募史莱姆吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7007", "source_sha256": "6286dfdebf1a00f4d5224b7608f1a4fa2c0c3a9347053930944bc8c7b4129d77", "ja": "かわいいスライム", "zh": "可爱的史莱姆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7008", "source_sha256": "d547e0f1bff0ff194740b37beaec0038845cc404cc518e2d2841f329497ec009", "ja": "かっこいいスライム", "zh": "帅气史莱姆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7200_p", "source_sha256": "e573c8ce59e6ca28950c3a494c50807ef0e958671ec515645c5d681621c9eaad", "ja": "かわいいスライムとかかな……。たとえば、\nリボンやお花がついてると、ちょっと気になると思う。", "zh": "可爱的史莱姆之类的吧……比如\n戴着蝴蝶结或者小花的话，应该会让人挺在意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7201_024ann", "source_sha256": "b65169137f9b356104e8d37b1313abf63c1f219917fc92a5997edc8a32d25139", "ja": "うん……。杏奈も、すっごく気になる……。\nオシャレさんな、スライム……絶対、かわいい……♪", "zh": "嗯……杏奈也超~在意……  \n时髦的史莱姆……绝对很可爱……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7202_024ann", "source_sha256": "18bcd943c61740b80d7d9ee559ac450d3983c982bae9e986a8b2bbd5aa038ab7", "ja": "もしかしたら、小道具にあるかも……。ちょっと\n待ってて……スタッフさんに聞いてみる、ね……♪", "zh": "说不定道具里就有……。稍微\n等一下……我去问问工作人员……呀……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7300_p", "source_sha256": "e573c8ce59e6ca28950c3a494c50807ef0e958671ec515645c5d681621c9eaad", "ja": "かわいいスライムとかかな……。たとえば、\nリボンやお花がついてると、ちょっと気になると思う。", "zh": "可爱的史莱姆之类的吧……比如\n戴着蝴蝶结或者小花的话，应该会让人挺在意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7301_024ann", "source_sha256": "81ea992a48c0ac3e7e171211da5c19df471c2cf3f0cf34fcbb571ea32ccb6b32", "ja": "たしかに……。色違いの、リボンだったり……\nお花も、毎日違う種類……。ふふ、かわいい……。", "zh": "确实……不同颜色的蝴蝶结什么的……\n花朵也每天换不同的种类……呵呵，好可爱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7302_024ann", "source_sha256": "d7b746f53dbcdab7ffa44a48714a7c6af2fe90eca5c3494bb39ec92f3f7547a8", "ja": "あ……でも、どうやって、つけるんだろ……。\nスライムの、頭……？　それとも、あれは……体……？", "zh": "啊……不过，要怎么戴上去呢……  \n史莱姆的头……？还是说，那是……身体……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7500_p", "source_sha256": "3907bdd31a4d961d25cb19e13d81475dd38c04d8ea773d0d57eaa7445395d380", "ja": "強くて迫力のある、かっこいいスライムもいいな。\nモンスター界で憧れの存在になれるかもしれない！", "zh": "强大又有魄力、帅气的史莱姆也很棒呢。\n说不定能在怪物界成为令人憧憬的存在哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7501_024ann", "source_sha256": "d8378b049bc4f1d25122a990c9e91ecf75878ed9902691b680e6fb6216b85252", "ja": "かっこいいの、杏奈も好きです……♪　スライムにも、\n牙があったり……トゲトゲしたのも、いるよ……。", "zh": "帅气的，杏奈也喜欢……♪史莱姆里也有长着獠牙的……还有浑身尖刺的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7502_024ann", "source_sha256": "d27b8297fb6391bb3d76c8a06a50f615b3e0e3f0e928883820083f3a71415e1b", "ja": "でも、魔法が使えるのが……一番、かっこいい……♪\n杏奈……スライムに、なりたくなってきたかも……。", "zh": "不过，会使用魔法……才是最帅的……♪\n杏奈……好像开始想变成史莱姆了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7600_p", "source_sha256": "3907bdd31a4d961d25cb19e13d81475dd38c04d8ea773d0d57eaa7445395d380", "ja": "強くて迫力のある、かっこいいスライムもいいな。\nモンスター界で憧れの存在になれるかもしれない！", "zh": "强大又有魄力、帅气的史莱姆也很棒呢。\n说不定能在怪物界成为令人憧憬的存在哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7601_024ann", "source_sha256": "5c42538fc369ea69a4de788a0fc59adce39734bca845a7262faded1882a5404a", "ja": "ん……杏奈も、わかる……。強いスライムに、出会うと\n……ちょっと、テンション上がっちゃう……。", "zh": "嗯……杏奈也懂……要是遇到了很强的史莱姆\n……情绪就会，有点高涨起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_7602_024ann", "source_sha256": "e9a5d17337de5aa34a8af8e8209b0251d855fe4dea5e3150d25e67eb36c91ef8", "ja": "今やってるゲームに、いたかも……。えっとね……\nあ、あれ……？　ゲーム機の充電、切れちゃった……。", "zh": "正在玩的游戏里，好像有过……那个……\n啊，咦……？游戏机没电了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
